{
  "_comment": "Device run for the N95 kiosk. Start with: server.py --matrix matrix-device.json, then open the client on the lab Chrome. Each run: warmup s, then dwell s of measurement. Panel is 3840x2160@30 unless the TV mode is changed. Runs with source=cuda need the server started from a venv with CuPy (requirements-lab.txt).",
  "warmup": 6,
  "dwell": 30,
  "base": {
    "gpu": "0",
    "complexity": 2,
    "gop": 1.0,
    "bitrate": "8M"
  },
  "runs": [
